    {
      "id": "welcome",
      "title": "Welcome to the Test island",
      "label": "Welcome",
      "at": [-7, 9.5],
      "facing": 40,
      "words": "You found your first sign. Walking up to a sign opens its card; tapping or clicking a sign does too. Walk with W, A, S and D or the arrow keys (Shift runs), or with the thumb stick on a phone, and drag to look around. The Places button lists every place on the island."
