    {
      "id": "palm-beach",
      "title": "Palm beach",
      "label": "Palm beach",
      "at": [-21.5, 6],
      "facing": 80,
      "words": "These palms, and every tree, rock and flower here, are toys from the Splashery shelf, built from their recipes on your device and placed by the world file. Walk into a trunk: you can't pass through it. Collision uses invisible simple shapes around each prop.",
